e6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"78bf29d1a4f75a6d","term":"몸살","zh":"浑身难受，过劳而病","audio":"/audio/78bf29d1a4f75a6d621f.mp3","entryId":"54741","definition":"身体过度疲劳时，全身酸痛无力、发烧的病症。","pronunciation":["몸살"]},{"id":"0c2854dfa760475d","term":"지독하다","zh":"极重","audio":"/audio/0c2854dfa760475d2bda.mp3","entryId":"76931","definition":"病情严重到无以复加的程度。","pronunciation":["지도카다"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发，闹","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身体上产生某种现象或生病。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/339d473cf12184a75aef.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.453,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76931","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.2797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，看来是感冒得特别严重啊。","还疼得很厉害吗？","妈妈，那只长得像狗的动物叫什么？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还疼得很厉害吗？","妈妈，那只长得像狗的动物叫什么？","嗯，看来是感冒得特别严重啊。"],"answer":2}]}
